---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="AI Consulting - Adventa">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>AI Consulting</h1>
      <p>Strategic guidance to implement AI solutions that deliver measurable business value.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Comprehensive AI consulting services to guide your transformation</p>
      
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>AI Strategy Development</h3>
          <p>We work with your leadership team to develop a comprehensive AI strategy aligned with your business goals. This includes identifying high-impact use cases, prioritizing initiatives, and building a roadmap for implementation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Technology Assessment</h3>
          <p>Our experts evaluate your current technology stack and infrastructure to determine readiness for AI adoption. We identify gaps, recommend solutions, and help you make informed technology decisions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Implementation Roadmaps</h3>
          <p>We create detailed implementation plans with clear milestones, resource requirements, and success metrics. Our phased approach ensures smooth adoption and minimizes disruption to your operations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>ROI Analysis</h3>
          <p>Before you invest, we help you understand the potential return. Our financial modeling and business case development ensures you can make data-driven decisions about AI investments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Change Management</h3>
          <p>Successful AI adoption requires more than technology. We help you manage the human side of transformation, including training, communication, and organizational change.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Ongoing Support</h3>
          <p>Our engagement doesn't end at implementation. We provide ongoing support, monitoring, and optimization to ensure your AI solutions continue to deliver value.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Our Approach</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">A proven methodology for AI success</p>
      <div class="card" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          We believe in a collaborative, iterative approach to AI consulting. We start by deeply understanding your business challenges and objectives. From there, we identify the most impactful AI opportunities and develop solutions that integrate seamlessly with your existing operations.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1rem;">
          Our team brings together expertise in machine learning, data science, software engineering, and business strategy. This multidisciplinary approach ensures that our recommendations are not just technically sound, but also commercially viable and operationally practical.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>